5e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}blum\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CostGraph}_{\\Phi}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\beta(e),\\langle\\beta(x),\\beta(m)\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}:e,x,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land(x,m)\\in\\Phi(e)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}blum\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CostGraph}_{\\Phi}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\beta(e),\\langle\\beta(x),\\beta(m)\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}:e,x,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land(x,m)\\in\\Phi(e)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}blum\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Blum}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow[\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{PFun}(\\Phi(e),\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi(e))=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e))]\\land\\operatorname{CostGraph}_{\\Phi}\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}blum\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Blum}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow[\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{PFun}(\\Phi(e),\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi(e))=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e))]\\land\\operatorname{CostGraph}_{\\Phi}\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>第一公理只让已收敛计算有代价；第二公理要求精确代价关系可判定。只要求每个 Φ(e) 单独可计算仍不足以代替第二个统一公理。编码三元参数使用明确嵌套配对，不把数值与词参数混用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的普通编号 $\\varphi_e$ 与 $\\beta$，及 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的同一有效编码包 $\\mathcal E$。$\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^2)$ 为候选代价图族，$\\operatorname{PFun}$ 见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]，$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","l